GeoAI Skills external GeoAnalystBench-derived subset

This subset was independently authored with synthetic data and is inspired by
task categories published in:

  GeoDS/GeoAnalystBench
  https://github.com/GeoDS/GeoAnalystBench
  pinned source ref: b5d8c40a8d23639ec77e9acb11f79fd033c07338

GeoAnalystBench is described by:

  Zhang, Q., Gao, S., Wei, C., Zhao, Y., Nie, Y., Chen, Z., Chen, S.,
  Su, Y., & Sun, H. (2025). GeoAnalystBench: A GeoAI benchmark for
  assessing large language models for spatial analysis workflow and code
  generation. Transactions in GIS, 29(7), e70135.

No upstream dataset, reference implementation, or verbatim benchmark prompt is
distributed in this directory.
